<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Examples of a Contributor include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, the name of a Contributor should be used to indicate the entity."@en;
                                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://dublincore.org/usage/terms/history/#contributor-006>;
