<http://purl.org/semsur/A_Plug-in_for_Importing_Schemas_and_Data_from_Relational_Databases_into_Protégé> a [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#author> ; 
