<http://purl.org/semsur/A_Tool_for_Generating_OWL_Ontologies_From_Relational_Database_Systems> a [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#author> ; 
                                                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#Person> ; 
                                                                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
