<http://purl.org/semsur/ICWE> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#publishes> <http://purl.org/semsur/From_Relational_Data_to_RDFS_Models>;
                              a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
