<http://purl.org/semsur/IEEE> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
                                <http://purl.org/semsur/InformationAsset>.
<http://purl.org/semsur/IJCAI> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#publishes> <http://purl.org/semsur/LIMES_-_A_Time-Efficient_Approach_for_Large-Scale_Link_Discovery_on_the_Web_of_Data>;
