<http://purl.org/semsur/ISWC> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#publishes> <http://purl.org/semsur/An_Adaptive_Query_Processing_Engine_for_SPARQL_Endpoints>,
                                                                            <http://purl.org/semsur/Discovering_and_Maintaining_Links_on_the_Web_of_Data>,
                                                                            <http://purl.org/semsur/Logic-based_and_Scalable_Ontology_Matching>,
                                                                            <http://purl.org/semsur/a_federation_layer_for_distributed_query_processing_on_linked_open_data>;
                              a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>,
