<http://purl.org/semsur/RegularPaper> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#author> ; 
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <http://swrc.ontoware.org/ontology#Person> ; 
