<http://purl.org/semsur/WoDQA> semsur:addressProblem <http://purl.org/semsur/Query_Execution>,
                                                     <http://purl.org/semsur/Source_Selection>,
                                                     <http://purl.org/semsur/SPARQL_query_Federation>;
